Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:12:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] feat(events): spool_created event when a scanned tag
 creates a Spoolman spool

Moonraker already tells Happy Hare with CREATED=1, which was only logged. The new _MMU_EVENT EVENT=spool_created SPOOLID= GATE= lets a user macro act on a new spool, for example to offer a calibration. GATE is -1 for a shared reader, whose gate is only known when the spool loads.
---
